== exact O(kappa) identity:  sum E*L_xi phi  + c * sum_{mn} (dh_mn) T_mn = 0  for all phi, xi ==
m2= 0.00 L=3: fitted c = -0.500000; max residual |a + c b| = 0.0
m2= 0.00 L=4: fitted c = -0.500000; max residual |a + c b| = 0.0
